          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Jan 24 2025 20:07:00 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Innovative torque for reliable control</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The microfabricated slits in the hypotube serve to maintain the flexibility of the guideware, providing 1:1 torque without sacrificing flexibility.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">A</span>&nbsp; Conventional guidewire - Torque transmission</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">B</span><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">&nbsp; Synchro Guidewire - Torque transmission</span></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Mar 04 2025 15:23:18 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
